{
  "id": "section-328",
  "title": "对劳动部关于召开全国劳动保护会议向中央报告的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-031.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>031)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　在实施增产节约的同时，必须注意职工的安全，健康和必不可少的福利事业；如果只注意前一方面，忘记或稍加忽视后一方面，那是错误的。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-030.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-032.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
